      },
      "abstract": "Obliviate erases concepts from autoregressive image generators by aligning conditional and pseudo-unconditional branches on shared visual prefixes, then applying KL supervision over full generation trajectories. Evaluated on Liquid, Emu3-Gen, and Janus-Pro, it removes targets like nudity or brands without collapsing model utility.",
      "projectPage": "https://jonasgrebe.github.io/research/projects/obliviate/",
      "pdf": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.28643",
